[[0,177269,0,2,0,2,"2015-06-28T04:59:08","mkj","",[],"<p>Pierce Brown recently stated on social media that he's taking a break to finish Morning Star. </p>\n<p><em>Howlers and casual readers, I beg your forbearance. I will not be answering emails or pages or posts with much regularity these next two weeks before San Diego Comic-Con (which I certainly shall be attending). The time has come for a bloodydamn all out helldiver kamikaze push towards the end of Morning Star. Fare thee well, my goodmen and goodladies, I ride into night (and caffeine overload) but I promise you, morning waits on the other side. Per aspera ad Astra.\r\nHowler 1</em></p>","Pierce Brown finishing Morning Star!","","redrisingtrilogy"]]
